# Flavors of Our Lives (adoulin 46), the Blightberry: a level 99 Warrior in Western Adoulin with a Sickle,
# ENABLE_HELM_WAIT on (a setting), the quest accepted (a GM). Prog 0 with the Blightberry (a GM): Berghent 82 (the
# reward section needs Prog 3 too). The Blightberry taken back, Prog 2 (GMs), in the Yahse Hunting Grounds beside the
# first Harvesting Point: the Sickle traded: no trade handler: nothing. Prog 3 (a GM): with ENABLE_HELM_WAIT on
# xi.helm.onTrade returns before pickItem while GetSystemTime() < the local var [HELM]LastAttempt + 3 (pickItem, which
# upstream raised in at zone 260, finds nothing there since user ruling 2026-11-05: #raise); with that var at
# 2000000000 (a GM; in play a second trade within 3 s of the first) the handler goes on to its
# Blightberry action: the key item (KEYITEM_OBTAINED). Prog 3 with it: the trade has no handler: nothing. Back in
# Western Adoulin: Berghent 87, finished: completed (300 bayld, 500 exp, Potation Pathfinder; no fame area), the
# Blightberry kept; completed: 88.
lists YahseHuntingGrounds/Harvesting_Point/onTrade WesternAdoulin/Berghent/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/87
char zone=WesternAdoulin pos=97.221,-0.148,-28.68 job=WAR lvl=99
setting ENABLE_HELM_WAIT true
quest Adoulin.FlavorsOfOurLives accepted
keyitem Blightberry
item Sickle
login
trigger Berghent                        # Prog 0 with the Blightberry (a GM): 82
finish
delkeyitem Blightberry                  # a GM
charvar Quest[9][46]Prog 2              # a GM
warp 164.33,0,-283.7 YahseHuntingGrounds
trade Harvesting_Point Sickle x1        # Prog 2: no trade handler: nothing
charvar Quest[9][46]Prog 3              # a GM
localvar [HELM]LastAttempt 2000000000   # a GM
trade Harvesting_Point Sickle x1        # Prog 3: the Blightberry
trade Harvesting_Point Sickle x1        # Prog 3 with it: nothing
warp 97.221,-0.148,-28.68 WesternAdoulin
trigger Berghent                        # Prog 3 with the Blightberry: 87
finish                                  # completed
trigger Berghent                        # completed: 88
finish
